    "limitations": [
      "B71/B73: Kemadruma OR/AND and aspect semantics conflict. Do not score its adverse claims or infer cancellation from absence. XIII.8\u20139 requires Moon/participating bodies strength and context; XIII.30 ordinal intensity and XIII.31 observed halo not implemented.",
      "B135: Moon exclusion on both Sun sides vs only second is unresolved; allow twelfth Moon as an explicit alternative, with no invented Moon-specific clause. Node inclusion not adjudicated; both arms exclude nodes.",
      "B136: XIV.10 requires Sun and planets strength and sign/divisional context; Vesi steadiness and effort wording differs from BPHS. Work is English-witness specific; firmness is proxy.",
      "B113: XXIII.86 (alternate numbering 88) needs strength of Moon, Moon sign and its lord for FULL effects. B114: Navamsa lord strong vs stronger than Rasi lord unresolved; no override presumed.",
      "Unscaled condition is conditional only, not actual strength certification. Attenuation envelope admits zero and either direction of conflict; no invented numeric strength multiplier.",
      "The Capricorn base sign passage mentions both charity and miserliness; the shared giving item is not assigned a direction. Do not use the modern website editorial sign-dignity summaries as source text."
    ]
